<p><strong>DIVERSITY AND EXCELLENCE</strong></p>

<p>Over 60 years providing access to a wide selection of more than 100,000 students from over 80 countries.</p>

<p><strong>Are you looking for international profiles to promote your company and its internships and graduate positions?</strong></p>

<p>At IAESTE we help you!</p>

<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Tailored profile: possibility to select specialty, level of study, languages, duration and additional requirements</li>

<li>Time saving: we work on finding the best profiles. Candidates are pre-assessed and filtered by IAESTE to present the most suitable candidate for your offer. </li>

<li>Integration: our IAESTE Spain volunteers are in continuous contact with students on internships to ensure their adaptation.</li>
</ul>

<p>How to participate in our internship program focused on attracting international talent?</p>

<p>Send an email to <a href="mailto:office@iaeste.es">office@iaeste.es</a> and we will contact you</p>

